                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="comment"><%= t('homepage.review4') %>As a mechanic, keeping my workshop organized has always been a challenge. I can label compartments for different tools, parts, and equipment. Need a specific wrench or socket? Just type it into the search bar, and voila! The highlighted results show me exactly where it is.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
